# Marine intel from the Bad Blood clan: bracer data-cores (FLOW-505) and Lodge raid loot (FLOW-507)

# What the intel says about the clan ship
cmu-bad-blood-intel-ship-quiet = No ship call is running. The clan holds fewer than 3 ripe Totems.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-ship-hold = The clan is holding its Totems for a ship call. If the hold is not broken, their ship is in orbit in about { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-ship-inbound = The clan ship is inbound and reaches orbit in about { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    }. Destroying the Lodge turns it back.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-ship-arrived = The clan ship is in orbit. It leaves with its trophies in about { $minutes } { $minutes ->
        [one] minute
       *[other] minutes
    } if the Lodge still stands.

# Bracer data-core
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-verb = Decrypt data-core
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-verb-message = Pull the clan's records out of this bracer. Needs intel training. Reveals their Lodge on the tactical map and tells you about their ship.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-not-core = There is no data-core in that.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-done = The data-core has already been decrypted.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-clan = You know what is in your own bracer.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-unskilled = You have no idea how to get anything out of this. Someone trained in intel might.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-scuttle = The bracer is counting down to blow. Get away from it!
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-worn = Its owner is still wearing it.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-start = You start working through the bracer's alien data-core...
cmu-bad-blood-intel-decrypt-finished = You crack the data-core. Their Lodge is on the tactical map for 60 seconds. { $ship } Take the bracer to the intel area, or wire it into an uplink site for the clan signature.

# Lodge raid loot
cmu-bad-blood-intel-star-chart-recovered = You recognise the marked course on the star chart. It carries the clan's signature. { $ship } Take it to the intel area.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-verb = Strip a trophy
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-verb-message = Tear one of the clan's trophies off the Lodge rack. Each one is intel for the intel area.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-clan = You would not take from your own Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-empty = Nothing hangs on the Lodge rack.
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-start = You start tearing a trophy off the Lodge rack...
cmu-bad-blood-intel-strip-finished = You tear { THE($trophy) } off the Lodge rack. Take it to the intel area.
